<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id" />
  <para style="h">I Timothée</para>
  <para style="toc1">I TIMOTHÉE</para>
  <para style="toc2">I Timothée</para>
  <para style="toc3">I Tim</para>
  <para style="mt1">I TIMOTHÉE</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1" />Paul, yon apot a Kris Jésus <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 1:3">Tit 1:3</ref></char></note>selon kòmandman Bondye a, Sovè nou an, e a Kris Jésus ki se esperans nou. <verse eid="1TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2" />A Timothée, vrè pitit mwen nan lafwa mwen an: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:7">Wo 1:7</ref></char></note>lagras, mizerikòd, ak lapè ki soti nan Bondye Papa a, e Senyè nou an, Jésus Kri.<verse eid="1TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3" />Jan mwen te ankouraje ou sou depa mwen pou Macédoine nan, rete an Éphèse pou nou kapab enstwi sèten moun pou yo pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:17">Wo 16:17</ref></char></note>enstwi yon lòt doktrin nèf; <verse eid="1TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4" />ni pou yo pa prete atansyon a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 4:7">I Tim 4:7</ref></char></note>fo istwa ak jeneyaloji ki pa janm fini, e ki ankouraje espekilasyon olye pou yo fè avanse jerans Bondye pa lafwa a.<verse eid="1TI 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5" />Men bi a enstriksyon nou an se lanmou ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 2:22">II Tim 2:22</ref></char></note>soti nan yon kè san tach, bon konsyans ak yon lafwa ki sensè. <verse eid="1TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6" />Paske kèk moun, nan egare kite bagay sa yo pou vin detounen nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 1:10">Tit 1:10</ref></char></note>diskou ki pa pote fwi, <verse eid="1TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7" />ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 3:1">Jc 3:1</ref></char></note>ta vle mèt k ap enstwi lalwa, menmsi yo pa menm konprann ni sa y ap di a, ni sijè ke yo pale avèk plen konfyans lan.<verse eid="1TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8" />Men nou konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 7:12">Wo 7:12</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 7:16">16</ref></char></note>Lalwa bon, si yon moun itilize li nan yon fason lejitim. <verse eid="1TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9" />Reyalize ke Lalwa pa fèt pou yon nonm ki dwat, men pou sila ki san prensip e ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 1:6">Tit 1:6</ref>,<ref loc="TIT 1:10">10</ref></char></note>rebèl yo, pou sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 4:18">I Pi 4:18</ref></char></note>san Bondye ak pechè yo, pou sila ki pa sen ak mechan yo, pou sila ki touye papa oswa manman yo, pou asasen yo, <verse eid="1TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10" />epi pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:9">I Kor 6:9</ref></char></note>moun imoral ak moun k ap mennen vi gason ak gason, fanm ak fanm yo, e sila ki fè komès esklav ak mantè yo, e sila ki bay fo temwayaj ak tout lòt kalite bagay ki kontrè a bon doktrin yo, <verse eid="1TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11" />selon levanjil laglwa Bondye ki beni an, li menm ke yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:7">Gal 2:7</ref></char></note>konfye m nan.<verse eid="1TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12" />Mwen remèsye Kris Jésus Senyè nou an, ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:22">Trav 9:22</ref></char></note>ranfòse mwen, paske Li te konsidere mwen fidèl e te mete m an sèvis: <verse eid="1TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13" />malgre ke avan sa, mwen te yon blasfematè, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Trav 8:3</ref></char></note>pèsekitè e yon agresè vyolan. Malgre sa, mwen te resevwa gras akoz mwen te aji avèk inyorans nan enkwayans. <verse eid="1TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14" />Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:20">Wo 5:20</ref></char></note>lagras Senyè nou an te plis ke anpil, avèk lafwa ak lanmou ki twouve nan Kris Jésus a. <verse eid="1TI 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 3:1">I Tim 3:1</ref></char></note>Li se yon vrè pawòl, ki merite aksepte pa tout moun, ke Kris Jésus te vini nan mond lan pou sove pechè yo, pami sila yo, mwen menm se premye a. <verse eid="1TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16" />Malgre tout, se pou rezon sa a, ke mwen te twouve gras; pouke nan mwen, kòm chèf pami pechè yo, Jésus Kris ta kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:7">Ef 2:7</ref></char></note>montre pasyans pafè Li a, kòm yon egzanp pou sila ki ta kwè nan Li yo pou lavi etènèl.<verse eid="1TI 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17" />Koulye a, pou Wa etènèl la, imòtèl la, envizib la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:44">Jn 5:44</ref></char></note>sèl Bondye a; lonè ak laglwa pou tout tan e pou tout tan. Amen.<verse eid="1TI 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18" />Lòd sa a mwen konfye a ou menm, Timothée, fis mwen an, ki an akò avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 4:14">I Tim 4:14</ref></char></note>pwofesi a konsènan ou menm ki te fèt deja, ke pa yo menm, ou te mennen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 10:4">II Kor 10:4</ref></char></note>bon konba a, <verse eid="1TI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19" />nan kenbe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 1:5">I Tim 1:5</ref></char></note>lafwa ak yon bon konsyans, ke kèk moun te rejte, e te fè nofraj nan sa ki gen rapò a lafwa yo. <verse eid="1TI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20" />Pami sila yo, se Hyménée ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:14">II Tim 4:14</ref></char></note>Alexandre, ke mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 5:5">I Kor 5:5</ref></char></note>livre a Satan pou yo kab aprann pou yo pa fè blasfèm.<verse eid="1TI 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1" />Dabò, alò, mwen ankouraje pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:18">Ef 6:18</ref></char></note>siplikasyon ak priyè, rekèt ak remèsiman fèt pou tout moun, <verse eid="1TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 6:10">Esd 6:10</ref></char></note>pou wa ak tout sila ki nan otorite yo, pou nou kapab mennen yon vi trankil e kalm nan tout sentete ak dignite.<verse eid="1TI 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3" />Sa bon e akseptab nan zye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:47">Luc 1:47</ref></char></note>Bondye, Sovè nou an, <verse eid="1TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 4:10">I Tim 4:10</ref></char></note>ki dezire pou tout moun vin sove e vini a konesans a verite a. <verse eid="1TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5" />Paske gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:30">Wo 3:30</ref></char></note>yon Bondye, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:20">Gal 3:20</ref></char></note>medyatè osi antre Bondye ak lòm, ki se nonm nan, Jésus Kri, <verse eid="1TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6" />ki te bay tèt li kòm ranson pou tout moun, temwayaj ke Li te bay nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 6:15">I Tim 6:15</ref></char></note>pwòp lè li a. <verse eid="1TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7" />Pou sa, mwen te chwazi kòm predikatè ak apot (m ap bannou verite, mwen p ap bannou manti), kòm yon mèt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 3:8">Ef 3:8</ref></char></note>pou enstwi pèp etranje yo nan lafwa ak verite a.<verse eid="1TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8" />Konsa, mwen vle moun tout kote priye; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 63:4">Sòm 63:4</ref></char></note>vin leve men sen yo, san kòlè ak doute. <verse eid="1TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9" />Menm jan an, mwen vle <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:3">I Pi 3:3</ref></char></note>fanm yo abiye yo menm avèk vètman ki kòrèk, senp e avèk desans, pa avèk cheve trese ak lò oswa pèl oswa rad ki koute chè, <verse eid="1TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10" />men, de preferans, pa mwayen a bon zèv, jan sa kòrèk pou fanm ki nonmen non Bondye yo.<verse eid="1TI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11" />Yon fanm dwe resevwa enstriksyon an silans ak tout soumisyon.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 14:34">I Kor 14:34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 14:34">I Kor 14:34</ref></char></note>Men mwen pa pèmèt yon fanm enstwi oubyen ekzèse otorite sou yon gason, men li rete an silans. <verse eid="1TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:7">Jen 2:7</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 2:22">22</ref></char></note>Paske se te Adam ki te kreye avan, e answit, Eve. <verse eid="1TI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14" />Epi se pa t Adam ki te twonpe a, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:6">Jen 3:6</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 3:13">13</ref></char></note>fanm nan te twonpe, e yo te tonbe nan transgresyon. <verse eid="1TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15" />Men fanm yo va sove nan fè pitit si yo kontinye nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 1:14">I Tim 1:14</ref></char></note>lafwa ak lanmou, sentete ak kontwòl tèt yo.<verse eid="1TI 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1" />Sa se yon vrè pawòl: Si yon nonm ta vle devni yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:28">Trav 20:28</ref></char></note>pastè, se yon bon zèv li dezire fè a. <verse eid="1TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 3:2-4">Tit 3:2-4</ref></char></note>Yon pastè, alò, dwe san repwòch, mari a yon madanm, tanpere, pridan, respektab, emab, avèk yon kapasite pou enstwi. <verse eid="1TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3" />Li pa dwe bwè diven ak eksè, oswa agresif, men janti, pezib, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 3:8">I Tim 3:8</ref></char></note>lib de lanmou lajan. <verse eid="1TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4" />Li dwe yon moun ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 3:12">Tit 3:12</ref></char></note>jere pwòp kay li byen, e ki kenbe pitit li yo anba bon kontwòl avèk tout dignite; <verse eid="1TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5" />(men si yon moun pa konnen kijan pou l jere pwòp kay li, kijan li va pran swen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:32">I Kor 10:32</ref></char></note>legliz Bondye a?) <verse eid="1TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6" />Fòk li pa yon nouvo konvèti, pou li kab pa vin ògeye, e tonbe nan kondanasyon ki fèt pa pèlen Dyab la. <verse eid="1TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7" />Li dwe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 8:21">II Kor 8:21</ref></char></note>gen bon repitasyon avèk sila ki deyò legliz yo, pou li pa tonbe nan repwòch ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 2:26">II Tim 2:26</ref></char></note>pèlen Satan.<verse eid="1TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8" />Dyak yo, menm jan an, dwe se moun ki gen dignite, ki pa ipokrit, oubyen renmen bwè diven ak twòp eksè, oubyen renmen lajan twòp <verse eid="1TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 1:5">I Tim 1:5</ref>,<ref loc="1TI 1:19">19</ref></char></note>men ki kenbe a mistè lafwa a avèk yon konsyans ki pwòp. <verse eid="1TI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 5:22">I Tim 5:22</ref></char></note>Mesye sa yo dwe, osi, pase tès avan; answit, kite yo sèvi kòm dyak si yo pa gen repwòch.<verse eid="1TI 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11" />Fanm yo dwe menm jan an, dign <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 3:3">II Tim 3:3</ref></char></note>pa nan fè medizans, men tanpere, fidèl nan tout bagay.<verse eid="1TI 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12" />Dyak yo dwe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 3:2">I Tim 3:2</ref></char></note>mari a yon sèl fanm, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 3:4">I Tim 3:4</ref></char></note>bon dirijan a pitit yo ak pwòp lakay yo. <verse eid="1TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13" />Paske sila ki sèvi byen kòm dyak yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:21">Mat 25:21</ref></char></note>resevwa pou tèt yo, yon wo pozisyon ak gwo konfyans nan lafwa ki nan Kris Jésus a.<verse eid="1TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14" />M ap ekri bagay sa yo bannou, avèk esperans ke m ap vin kote nou avan lontan, <verse eid="1TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15" />men an ka ke mwen pran reta, mwen ekri yo pou nou kab konnen kijan yon moun ta dwe kondwi tèt li nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:21">Ef 2:21</ref></char></note>kay Bondye a, ki se legliz a Bondye vivan an, ki se pilye ak soutyen verite a.<verse eid="1TI 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16" />San gen diskisyon, gran se mistè lavi sentete a:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Sila ki</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:14">Jn 1:14</ref></char></note>revele nan lachè a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Te jistifye nan Lespri a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Te wè pa zanj yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:26">Wo 16:26</ref></char></note>pwoklame pami nasyon yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Te resevwa kwayans mond lan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Te leve wo nan laglwa a.<verse eid="1TI 3:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1" />Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 16:13">Jn 16:13</ref></char></note>Lespri a di byen klè ke nan dènye tan yo, kèk moun va tonbe kite lafwa pou prete atansyon a Lespri twonpè ak doktrin a dyab yo, <verse eid="1TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2" />epi pa mwayen ipokrizi a mantè yo, vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:19">Ef 4:19</ref></char></note>make nan pwòp konsyans pa yo, kòmsi li brile avèk fè etanp ki cho; <verse eid="1TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3" />moun ki entèdi maryaj, e k ap rekòmande evite manje, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:3">Jen 9:3</ref></char></note>Bondye te kreye pou pataje avèk remèsiman pa sila ki kwè e ki konnen verite yo. <verse eid="1TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4" />Paske tout bagay kreye pa Bondye, bon, e anyen pa dwe rejte, si li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:6">Wo 14:6</ref></char></note>resevwa avèk remèsiman, <verse eid="1TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5" />paske li sanktifye pa mwayen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:25">Jen 1:25</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 1:31">31</ref></char></note>pawòl Bondye a ak lapriyè.<verse eid="1TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6" />Nan montre bagay sa yo a frè yo, nou va yon bon sèvitè a Kris Jésus, e nou va nouri tout tan nan pawòl lafwa ak bon doktrin ke nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 3:10">II Tim 3:10</ref></char></note>deja ap swiv yo. <verse eid="1TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7" />Men pa okipe vye listwa mond yo ki fèt pou vye fanm yo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 4:7">Sou lòt kote, disipline tèt ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 4:8">I Tim 4:8</ref></char></note>pou vi sentete a. <verse eid="1TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:23">Kol 2:23</ref></char></note>disiplin pou kò a sèlman, pa gen gran avantaj men vi sentete a gen avantaj nan tout jan, paske li kenbe pwomès pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:33">Mat 6:33</ref></char></note>lavi koulye a, e osi pou lavi k ap vini an.<verse eid="1TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TI 1:15">I Tim 1:15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sa se yon vrè Pawòl ki merite aksepte pa tout moun. <verse eid="1TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10" />Paske se pou sa nou travay ak fè efò a. Nou gen tan fikse <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 1:10">II Kor 1:10</ref></char></note>esperans nou sou Bondye vivan an, ki se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 2:4">I Tim 2:4</ref></char></note>Sovè a tout moun, sitou a kwayan yo.<verse eid="1TI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TI 5:7">I Tim 5:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Preskri e enstwi bagay sa yo.<verse eid="1TI 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12" />Pa kite pèsòn gade ou ba akoz jenès ou, men de preferans nan pawòl, kondwit <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 2:7">Tit 2:7</ref></char></note>lanmou, lafwa, ak yon vi san tach, prezante tèt ou kòm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 1:14">I Tim 1:14</ref></char></note>yon egzanp a sila ki kwè yo.<verse eid="1TI 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13" />Jiskaske m vini, bay enpòtans a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 3:15">II Tim 3:15</ref></char></note>li lekriti sen yo an piblik, a egzòtasyon ak enstriksyon.<verse eid="1TI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14" />Pa neglije don Lespri Bondye ki nan ou a, ki te bay a ou menm pa yon pawòl pwofetik avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:6">Trav 6:6</ref></char></note>men Ansyen ki te poze sou ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:30">Trav 11:30</ref></char></note>yo.<verse eid="1TI 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15" />Konsakre ou seryezman a bagay sa yo; antre ladan yo, pou pwogrè ou kapab klè a tout moun.<verse eid="1TI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 20:28">Trav 20:28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Prete anpil atansyon a tèt ou e ak enstriksyon ou an. Pèsevere nan bagay sa yo, paske lè ou fè sa, ou va asire Sali tèt ou ak sila ki tande ou yo.<verse eid="1TI 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:32">Lev 19:32</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pa bay repwòch ki di a yon granmoun, men, de preferans, rezone ak li tankou yon papa, a jèn mesye yo tankou frè yo, <verse eid="1TI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2" />a fanm avanse nan laj yo tankou manman, e jèn fanm yo tankou sè. Ak tout, san tach.<verse eid="1TI 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3" />Onore vèv ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:1">Trav 6:1</ref></char></note>vrèman vèv yo; <verse eid="1TI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4" />men si yon vèv gen pitit, oswa pitit pitit, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:2">Ef 6:2</ref></char></note>yo dwe, dabò, aprann pratike respè anvè pwòp fanmi pa yo, e repaye pwòp paran pa yo, paske sa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 2:3">I Tim 2:3</ref></char></note>akseptab devan zye Bondye. <verse eid="1TI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5" />Alò, sila ki vrèman yon vèv, e ki kite sèl la, fikse tout espwa l sou Bondye e kontinye nan siplikasyon ak lapriyè lajounen kon lannwit. <verse eid="1TI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6" />Men sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:5">Jc 5:5</ref></char></note>viv nan plezi a, mouri menm pandan ke li ap viv la. <verse eid="1TI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 4:11">I Tim 4:11</ref></char></note>Preskri bagay sa yo tou pou yo kapab vin san repwòch. <verse eid="1TI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8" />Men si yon moun pa bay soutyen a sila ki pou li yo, e sitou a sila ki lakay li yo, li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 2:12">II Tim 2:12</ref></char></note>gen tan kite lafwa e vin pi mal ke yon enkwayan.<verse eid="1TI 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9" />Yon vèv <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 5:16">I Tim 5:16</ref></char></note>dwe mete nan lis la sèlman si li pa gen mwens ke swasant ane, e te madanm a yon sèl moun, <verse eid="1TI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10" />avèk repitasyon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:36">Trav 9:36</ref></char></note>bon zèv, si li te elve timoun, si li te konn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 3:2">I Tim 3:2</ref></char></note>resevwa etranje byen, si li te lave pye a sen yo, si li te konn ede sila ki nan gwo pwoblèm yo, e si li te devwe tèt li a tout bon zèv.<verse eid="1TI 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11" />Men refize mete jèn vèv nan lis la, paske lè yo vin gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:7">Rev 18:7</ref></char></note>dezi sansyèl kont Kris la, y ap vle marye. <verse eid="1TI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12" />Konsa y ap vin merite kondanasyon paske yo mete sou kote ve ke yo te fè deja a. <verse eid="1TI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13" />An menm tan an, yo va aprann vin parese, pandan yo prale de kay an kay. E pa senpleman parese, men osi nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 3:11">II Tes 3:11</ref></char></note>fè tripotay ak antre bouch nan zafè a moun, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 1:11">Tit 1:11</ref></char></note>nan pale bagay ki pa bon pou pale.<verse eid="1TI 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14" />Konsa, mwen vle jèn vèv yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 7:9">I Kor 7:9</ref></char></note>marye, fè pitit, okipe kay, pou pa bay lènmi an plas pou repwòch. <verse eid="1TI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15" />Paske kèk nan yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 1:20">I Tim 1:20</ref></char></note>deja detounen pou swiv Satan.<verse eid="1TI 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16" />Si yon fanm ki se yon kwayan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 5:4">I Tim 5:4</ref></char></note>gen vèv ki depann de li, li dwe asiste yo e legliz la pa dwe pote chaj sa a, pou li kapab asiste sila ki vrèman vèv yo.<verse eid="1TI 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 11:30">Trav 11:30</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ansyen ki dirije byen yo, dwe konsidere dign de doub onè, sitou sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 5:12">I Tes 5:12</ref></char></note>travay di nan predikasyon ak enstriksyon yo. <verse eid="1TI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18" />Paske Lekriti a di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">Det 25:4</ref></char></note>“Nou pa dwe mete mizo nan bouch a bèf la pandan l ap moulen sereyal la,” epi: “Ouvriye a dign de salè li.”<verse eid="1TI 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19" />Pa resevwa yon akizasyon kont yon ansyen eksepte sou baz a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:6">Det 17:6</ref></char></note>de oswa twa temwen.<verse eid="1TI 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20" />Sila ki kontinye nan peche yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:14">Gal 2:14</ref></char></note>repwoche yo nan prezans a tout moun, pou lòt yo tou kapab pè fè peche. <verse eid="1TI 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 9:26">Luc 9:26</ref></char></note>Mwen solanèlman chaje ou nan prezans a Bondye, a Kris Jésus e a zanj chwazi Li yo, pou kenbe prensip sa yo san favorize pèsòn, e pa fè anyen nan yon lespri patipri.<verse eid="1TI 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TI 3:10">I Tim 3:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pa poze men sou okenn moun twò vit, e konsa vin pataje nan peche a lòt yo. Kenbe tèt ou lib de peche.<verse eid="1TI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23" />Pa bwè dlo sèl ankò, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 3:8">I Tim 3:8</ref></char></note>pran yon ti diven pou koz a vant ou ak maladi yo k ap boulvèse ou.<verse eid="1TI 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24" />Peche kèk moun vin toutafè klè, li ale devan yo pou jijman. Pou lòt yo, peche pa yo vini aprè yo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 14:13">Rev 14:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25" />Menm jan an tou, zèv ki bon yo toutafè klè, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 10:9">Pwov 10:9</ref></char></note>sila ki pa konsa yo, p ap kapab kache.<verse eid="1TI 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1" />Tout sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:5">Ef 6:5</ref></char></note>anba jouk esklavaj yo dwe gade pwòp mèt yo kòm moun ki dign de tout onè pou pèsòn pa kapab pale mal kont non a Bondye e ak doktrin nou an. <verse eid="1TI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2" />Sila ki gen kwayan kòm mèt yo pa dwe derespekte yo paske yo se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:28">Gal 3:28</ref></char></note>frè yo, men dwe sèvi yo plis toujou, paske sila ki pataje benefis yo se kwayan e byeneme. Enstwi e preche prensip sa yo.<verse eid="1TI 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3" />Si yon moun <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 1:3">Tit 1:3</ref></char></note>ap enstwi yon lòt doktrin, e pa dakò avèk bon pawòl sen, sila ki soti nan Senyè nou an, Jésus Kri, e avèk doktrin ki konfòm ak sentete a, <verse eid="1TI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4" />li se yon moun ògeye e pa konprann anyen, men li gen yon obsesyon pou poze kesyon diskisyon e fè kont pou mo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:15">Trav 18:15</ref></char></note>ki sòti nan lanvi, konfli, jouman, ak sispèk moun mal, <verse eid="1TI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5" />diskisyon san rete antre<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 3:8">II Tim 3:8</ref></char></note>moun ak panse konwonpi e san verite, ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:3">II Pi 2:3</ref></char></note>sipoze ke vi sentete a se yon mwayen pou fè pwofi.<verse eid="1TI 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6" />Men vi sentete a vrèman gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:15-21">Luc 12:15-21</ref></char></note>anpil pwofi lè l akonpanye ak kontantman. <verse eid="1TI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:21">Job 1:21</ref></char></note>nou pa t pote anyen nan mond lan, donk nou p ap kab retire anyen ladann pou soti nonplis.<verse eid="1TI 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8" />Si nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 30:8">Pwov 30:8</ref></char></note>genyen manje avèk rad, avèk sa yo, nou dwe kontan.<verse eid="1TI 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 15:27">Pwov 15:27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Men sila ki vle vin rich yo, tonbe nan tantasyon, yon pèlen plen foli ak move dezi ki konn plonje moun nan destriksyon ak pèdisyon. <verse eid="1TI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:5">Kol 3:5</ref></char></note>lanmou lajan se yon rasin a tout kalite mechanste, e kèk moun, akoz gwo lanvi pou li, gen tan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:19">Jc 5:19</ref></char></note>vin egare soti nan lafwa e pèse pwòp tèt yo ak anpil gwo doulè.<verse eid="1TI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11" />Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 2:22">II Tim 2:22</ref></char></note>kouri kite bagay sa yo, ou menm, moun Bondye a, e kouri dèyè ladwati, vi sentete, lafwa, lanmou, pèseverans, ak tandrès. <verse eid="1TI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 1:18">I Tim 1:18</ref></char></note>Mennen bon konba lafwa a. Kenbe fèm a lavi etènèl la pou sila ou te rele a, e te fè bon konfesyon nan prezans a anpil temwen yo. <verse eid="1TI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 5:21">I Tim 5:21</ref></char></note>Mwen kòmande ou nan prezans Bondye, ki bay lavi a tout bagay yo, e nan Kris Jésus ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 9:13">II Kor 9:13</ref></char></note>temwaye bon konfesyon devan Ponce Pilate la, <verse eid="1TI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14" />pou ou kenbe kòmandman an san tach oubyen repwòch, jiska <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 2:8">II Tes 2:8</ref></char></note>aparisyon Senyè nou an, Jésus Kri. <verse eid="1TI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15" />Li va fè rive nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 2:6">I Tim 2:6</ref></char></note>tan konvenab li—Sila ki beni e ki se sèl Souveren an, Wa a tout wa yo e Senyè tout senyè yo. <verse eid="1TI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 1:17">I Tim 1:17</ref></char></note>Sila sèl ki posede imòtalite a e ki rete nan limyè ke nou pa kapab menm apwoche a; Sila ke pèsòn pa janm wè oubyen pa kab wè a. A Li menm, lonè ak tout pouvwa pou tout tan e pou tout tan. Amen.<verse eid="1TI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17" />Enstwi sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:32">Mat 12:32</ref></char></note>rich nan mond sa yo pou pa vin ògeye ni plase espwa yo nan richès ki pa sèten, men nan Bondye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:17">Trav 14:17</ref></char></note>ki founi nou an abondans tout bagay nou bezwen pou fè nou kontan. <verse eid="1TI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18" />Enstwi yo pou fè sa ki bon, pou vin rich nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 5:10">I Tim 5:10</ref></char></note>bon zèv, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:18">Wo 12:18</ref></char></note>renmen bay, e toujou prèt pou pataje. <verse eid="1TI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19" />Konsa, y ap toujou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:20">Mat 6:20</ref></char></note>ranmase nan pwòp depo yo trezò a yon bon fondasyon pou lavni, pou yo kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 6:12">I Tim 6:12</ref></char></note>kenbe fèm a sa ki se vrèman lavi a.<verse eid="1TI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20" />O Timothée, gade byen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 1:12">II Tim 1:12</ref>,<ref loc="2TI 1:14">14</ref></char></note>sa ki konfye a ou menm nan, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 2:16">II Tim 2:16</ref></char></note>evite pale pawòl mond lan, pawòl vid e san sans, ak tout diskou fo pawòl yo rele “konesans” lan, <verse eid="1TI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21" />ke kèk moun te pwofese, e konsa yo te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 2:18">II Tim 2:18</ref></char></note>egare kite lafwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:21">Ke lagras avèk nou. Amen.<verse eid="1TI 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6" />
</usx>